<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines okays JG Summit savings bank.</title>
<headline>Philippines okays JG Summit savings bank.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Saturday it had approved the savings bank licence of conglomerate JG Summit Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>The bank, to be called JG Summit Savings Bank, will have authorised capital of one billion pesos.</p>
<p>JG Summit currently holds 29 percent equity in the Philippine International Commercial Bank and a 19 percent stake in Far East Bank and Trust Co.</p>
<p>Aside from banking, JG Summit has substantial interests in retail, airline, hotel, publishing and consumer food businesses.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
